  storyText: "Animal House\n\nThe Animals' gym stinks of sweat and growth hormones. Huge bodies, muscle grafts, zero necks. The codes are on a terminal in the back.\n\nMirage: \"Their security is from 2060. Give me a second.\"\n\n1. Fight your way through.\n2. Let Mirage kill the lights and sneak in."
